<h2>Home Office Design Ideas Worth Remembering — Office Fit-Out</h2>
<ul>
<li>Make sure your cables are organized by using cable tray or clip under desk — wires that are visible make elegantly designed space appear messy — MEP data done right.</li>
<li>Pick a workstation that has at least 1 drawer or storage area to ensure desk is clean when you make video calls — storage that does not kill sales floor.</li>
<li>If you're taking calls regularly, think about background you see on camera — acoustic panel or brand wall is better than blank wall or messy background — brand representation.</li>
<li>Put a rug or acoustic panel to create sense of space especially if office is in larger space — acoustic 0.8s not echo hall.</li>
</ul>

